msgctxt "xgettext:x:"
msgid "Accont number"
msgstr "账号"

msgctxt "xgettext:x:"
msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgctxt "xgettext:x:"
msgid ""
"As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under "
"the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be "
"claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was "
"debited. Your rights regarding this mandate are explained in a statement "
"that you can obtain from your bank."
msgstr ""
"根据您与银行签订的协议条款，您有权向银行申请退款。退款申请必须在账户扣款之日起 8 周内提出。您可向银行索取说明文件，了解您在此授权书项下的权利。"

msgctxt "xgettext:x:"
msgid ""
"By signing this mandate form, you authorise (A) the Creditor to send "
"instructions to your bank to debit your account, and (B) your bank to debit "
"your account in accordance with the instructions from the Creditor."
msgstr "签署此授权书即表示您授权：(A) 债权人向您的银行发送从您账户扣款的指令；(B) 您的银行按照债权人的指令从您的账户扣款。"

